As human labelers tag the incomplete data markups, the AI bot is actively learning from their human behavior, notes, and actions. The AI bot is also able to see in real-time the data tagging and corresponding metadata. Using this way, the AI bot is not only able to complete the process faster, but is also able to learn from the human tagger and iterate on the quality of the tagging, surpassing the number of data points that would be tagged by a machine alone or by a human alone. By conjoining the best of human and machine capability through crowdsourcing, it allows teams to reach higher levels of accuracy, eliminating human error and bot errors.

