This being said, there are some "off-the-shelf" solutions that allow you to compare different models "out-of-the-box". One of them is Hugging Face Model Hub, it provides pretty solid collection of pre-trained models (and new ones are added regularly) for representative (in the sense of hability to fine-tune over particular downstream task) tasks (text classification, translation, extractive summarization, etc).

